<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia TCV to hold bond tender on Thursday.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia TCV to hold bond tender on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said it will hold a bond tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue will be announced at 10.00 a.m. (2300 GMT).</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
